// probe: panics
// about: a panic's message, its `panic at FILE:LINE:` prefix included, goes to standard error while the program's prints stay on standard output (SL-768)
// stage 0: its record follows whichever stream Stage 0 writes, so it cannot pin the stream
// speeds: -O0 -O2
// prints: before
// panics: boom 7
func main() {
    print("before")
    panic("boom {}", 7)
}
